The Workflow
List all versions of the object, ordered from newest to oldest.

Iterate and Fetch Tags: For each version, check if it has the RELEASED tag.

Track the "Release" Points: Identify the index of the first (latest) and second "RELEASED" versions.

Target the Gap: Collect all VersionIds that exist chronologically between those two points.

Execute Batch Delete: Send a delete request for that specific list of IDs.
